  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "• Slice cucumber into half-moons. Roughly chop capsicum. Halve corn cob.\n• Drain and rinse red kidney beans.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/67d81b0118d6e477003fc9d1/step-c7cdec00.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• In a large frying pan, heat a drizzle of olive oil over medium-high heat.\n• Cook capsicum, until tender, 4-5 minutes.\n• Reduce pan to medium heat, add red kidney beans, Mexican Fiesta spice blend and tomato paste, and cook until fragrant, 1-2 minutes.\n• Remove pan from heat, add the water and stir to combine.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/67d81b0118d6e477003fc9d1/step-b56dc610.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Meanwhile, transfer corn cobs to a large microwave-safe plate. Cover with a damp paper towel. Microwave corn on high, until tender, 4-5 minutes.\n• Microwave pita bread on a microwave-safe plate for 1 minute, until warmed through.\n• In a large bowl, combine cucumber, mixed salad leaves and a drizzle of white wine vinegar and olive oil. Season to taste.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/67d81b0118d6e477003fc9d1/step-d9f7fb20.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Halve pita bread and fill with bean mixture, Cheddar cheese and Parmesan cheese.\n• Toast cheesy Mexican bean and capsicum pita pockets in a sandwich press as desired.\n• Divide between plates with corn cobs and cucumber salad. Serve with light sour cream. Enjoy!",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/67d81b0118d6e477003fc9d1/step-1e4dc130.jpg"
    }
  ]
